{"id":"CVE-2019-5443","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"hackerone","published":"2019-07-02T18:31:23.000Z","updated":"2026-10-14T06:35:43.420Z","description":"A non-privileged user or program can put code and a config file in a known non-privileged path (under C:/usr/local/) that will make curl <= 7.65.1 automatically run the code (as an openssl \"engine\") on invocation. If that curl is invoked by a privileged user it can do anything it wants.","cwe":["CWE-94 Code Injection (CWE-94)"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"curl","versions":["affected <= 7.65.1"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.0 <V3.1.5 (custom)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518F-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.0 <V3.1.5 (custom)"]},{"vendor":"Siemens","product":"SIPLUS S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP","defaultStatus":"unknown","versions":["affected V3.1.0 <V3.1.5 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/06/24/1","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20190624 curl: Windows OpenSSL engine code injection"},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108881","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"108881"},{"url":"https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2020.html","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuoct2019-5072832.html","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2020.html","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://curl.haxx.se/docs/CVE-2019-5443.html","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20191017-0002/","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-398330.html"}],"vendors":["curl"]}
